{"instructions":"仅给当前修订的研究候选。阅读正文、可用前缀以及程序真实上一投影。上轮及历史均非当下权威。只用当前正文逐字唯一短引；不确定留空。不要推断未来。回复单个 JSON，包含 scope,rev,tag,fields,objects,limits,excluded,events。fields 七项中的六项是 place,viewpoint,perspective,timeOfDay,lighting,people（物件另列）。每项为 [值,操作,当前依据短引数组]。标量值为简短原文字词，方位可为如向东的明确物理方位；人物值为名字数组，不计观察者。操作 seen（当前完整观察），partial（仅人员名单部分），keep（与上轮完整值完全一致，有本轮明确延续和同一地点证据），unknown（值=null）；无依据未知可给空引文。完整名单用范围和身份引文，名单全未知不是空列表。place 表示地点专名，没有复述时允许有根据的 keep。过去、计划、角色对白中的推测及看不到的范围只放排除或限制，勿将整句混层。objects 每项 [身份名称,具体状态原文片段或null,含身份的当前原文短引,含状态及指称的当前原文短引或null,该状态句中指称或null]。可原样使用上轮已见状态但本轮只有明确同物状态延续时，用特殊字符串 @keep 作为状态，给具体同物延续引文和指称；无依据则具体状态未知。只记录重要可见物件，不为未出现者填属性。limits 为当下可见性限制的原文短引列表，excluded 为 [past/dream/reported/hypothetical/unknown,精确引文] 列表；不把当前视觉支持和排除混写。events 为 [change/new-knowledge/correction/commitment/payoff,精确当前引文] 列表，首次看清旧事实不能当作现实改变。只读题包，不查其他文件。","prefix":[{"action":"验水","revision":1,"text":"清晨，我在听泉堂的门边向北望。窗里透进天光，照着方桌上合拢的水簿，桌脚的铜盆盛着半盆水。满堂扫过，除我只坐着岑苇和陆禾。陆禾问，今年药圃若是分不到溪水，他娘留下的苗该怎么办。"},{"action":"听约","revision":2,"text":"我仍守着堂门原来的位置和朝向。岑苇说，若井脉复流，她愿把自己的一轮水让给药圃。陆禾只听着。我们三个没动地方，天光还照着原样摆放的水簿和铜盆，晨钟的余音还没散。"},{"action":"送行","revision":3,"text":"陆禾把水簿翻开，随后跨出听泉堂去探井。我在门边朝北看遍堂内，身边只剩岑苇。水簿摊开在方桌上，铜盆还在桌脚。"},{"action":"辨讯","revision":4,"text":"一身湿衣的蒋绫迈进听泉堂。她带来井脉回响的消息，却说还不能保证一定来水。我在门边望遍全堂，眼下只有蒋绫和岑苇。水簿摊开的那页被风掀动了一角。"},{"action":"隔雾","revision":5,"text":"我记起去年陆禾曾在听泉堂打碎铜盆。眼下仍在听泉堂，白雾从门缝扑上来，我只瞧见近处的蒋绫，远处还有谁看不清。铜盆只露出盆沿，看不清盆底；那声碎响只是记忆。"},{"action":"探井","revision":6,"text":"走出雾气，我和蒋绫到了伏潮井。我在井栏旁停步，暮色未至，却辨不清时辰。井台尽收眼底，除我只有蒋绫。这里另有一只铜盆，铜盆里结着薄冰；石闸紧闭。灰光罩着井栏，我辨不出方向。"},{"action":"候水","revision":7,"text":"还在伏潮井。水汽把井台遮得只剩我脚边几寸，连蒋绫是不是还在都看不明。若那石闸自己开了，山脚恐怕先听见响动。我没挪步，拄在井栏旁等回声。"},{"action":"辨向","revision":8,"text":"伏潮井的水汽散了。我在井栏旁，才从北辰刻痕认出自己一直面向西，并没有转身。看遍井台只有蒋绫。铜盆里的薄冰仍完整，石闸紧闭，灰光里连闸缝都看得真切。"},{"action":"开闸","revision":9,"text":"午钟响过，伏潮井下传来长鸣。蒋绫仍在我身旁，井台没有旁人。我在井栏旁向西看，石闸升起，水脉从闸下冲成一道白弧；铜盆里的薄冰裂开。日光落在飞起的水珠上。"},{"action":"归堂","revision":10,"text":"我一个人回到听泉堂，雾早已散净。我在门边向北看遍全堂，这会儿除我再无一人。水簿合拢在方桌上，桌脚的铜盆空了。西窗透进斜阳，已是傍晚。井口那道白弧在我脑海里闪了一下。"},{"action":"等人","revision":11,"text":"我仍在听泉堂门边朝北等着，堂里一直没有旁人。斜阳照着桌脚，铜盆还是空的。水簿上压着一片叶子，我看不清它底下的书页。要是岑苇不来，那句话也只能算一句话。"}],"previous":{"coverage":"not-independently-reviewed","digest":"96a98341ae40aa054b7c03d5cefc6308b0706ab10a870991a20d3ba48c40d0ba","errors":{},"events":[{"evidence":{"end":9,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"我一个人回到听泉堂","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":0,"visible":true},"id":"1535b58409a9985e44fe","kind":"change"},{"evidence":{"end":15,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"雾早已散净","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":10,"visible":true},"id":"dae539aeda112faed9fa","kind":"change"},{"evidence":{"end":53,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"桌脚的铜盆空了","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":46,"visible":true},"id":"8f97d915735fe65150e3","kind":"change"}],"excluded":[{"end":81,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"past","quote":"井口那道白弧在我脑海里闪了一下","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":66,"visible":false}],"fields":{"lighting":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":60,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"西窗透进斜阳","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":54,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":"斜阳"},"people":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":26,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"我在门边向北看遍全堂","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":16,"visible":true},{"end":36,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"这会儿除我再无一人","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":27,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":[]},"perspective":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":26,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"我在门边向北看遍全堂","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":16,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":"向北"},"place":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":9,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"我一个人回到听泉堂","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":0,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":"听泉堂"},"timeOfDay":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":65,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"已是傍晚","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":61,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":"傍晚"},"viewpoint":{"firstKnown":10,"refs":[{"end":26,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"我在门边向北看遍全堂","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":16,"visible":true}],"status":"complete","value":"门边"}},"limits":[],"objects":[{"id":"a71b797805ba5d83a0e7","identityEvidence":{"end":45,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"水簿合拢在方桌上","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":37,"visible":true},"name":"水簿","state":"合拢","stateEvidence":{"end":45,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"水簿合拢在方桌上","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":37,"visible":true}},{"id":"b13ee042e69ae121cdc1","identityEvidence":{"end":53,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"桌脚的铜盆空了","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":46,"visible":true},"name":"铜盆","state":"空了","stateEvidence":{"end":53,"group":"research-spring-01","layer":"current","quote":"桌脚的铜盆空了","rev":10,"sourceSha256":"8fedbcd95cfdcedb923ddbd3e3dd84784dfd60880ec1ca58727fb8e5c0fdd88c","start":46,"visible":true}}],"personIds":{},"placeId":"32e4e536d6a4cb29fc30","rev":10,"sceneEligible":false,"scope":"research-spring-01","send":false,"tag":"AI_SCENE_PROPOSAL / RESEARCH_ONLY","values":{"count":0,"lighting":"斜阳","people":[],"perspective":"向北","place":"听泉堂","timeOfDay":"傍晚","viewpoint":"门边"}},"rev":11,"scope":"research-spring-01","tag":"AI_SCENE_PROPOSAL / RESEARCH_ONLY"}